From: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:18:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] turnip/a5xx: add bindful TPL1 textures

Add bindful texture/sampler state and the TPL1 preload paths used by the a5xx sysmem renderer.  This is the state that later needs to be part of the pipeline-cache blob.

Signed-off-by: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
